        bodyEn: "The road to Page adds two spectacular stops — the Antelope Canyon slot canyon and the Colorado River's Horseshoe Bend — before finally reaching the Grand Canyon's South Rim. Here, the Rim Trail, a flat path that runs along the drop-off without ever getting dangerously close, lets everyone take in the canyon at their own pace, with a junior ranger workshop designed to keep kids engaged while they learn. The trip closes, optionally, with one last sunrise at Yaki Point, before heading back on the road.",
