        bodyEn: "Reconstructed from authentic mills and houses gathered from across the region, the village of Zaanse Schans lets visitors see windmills still at work, once used to grind spices, oil and timber, from an era when the Zaan region counted more than a thousand industrial mills, the highest concentration on Earth.",
