        bodyEn: "Fringed by the Mesoamerican reef system, the world's second-largest after Australia's Great Barrier Reef, Roatán offers underwater visibility that often exceeds thirty metres. Spared the mass development that has transformed other Caribbean islands, it remains one of the region's most affordable and best-preserved diving destinations.",
